{
  "title": "Clothing, shopping and prices",
  "note": "Brazil's currency is the real, plural reais: dez reais. Compare with mais... (do) que: Esta camisa é mais cara que aquela. Demonstratives point by distance: este/esta (this, here), esse/essa (that, near you; also \"this\" in casual speech), aquele/aquela (that, over there).",
  "src": {"t": "Língua da Gente, Beginning 14: Everything is More Expensive", "u": "https://linguadagente.coerll.utexas.edu/beginning-everything-is-more-expensive/"},
